              "amharic": "ቡና ስንት ነው፧",
              "english": "How much is coffee?"
            },
            {
              "amharic": "ቡና ፲ ብር ነው።",
              "english": "Coffee is 10 birr."
            },
            {
              "amharic": "ሻይ ስንት ነው፧",
              "english": "How much is tea?"
            },
            {
              "amharic": "ሻይ ፭ ብር ነው።",
              "english": "Tea is 5 birr."
            },
            {
              "amharic": "ጥሩ! ሁለት ቡና!",
              "english": "Good! Two coffees!"
            }
          ],
          "note": "ብር (birr) is Ethiopian money, and ስንት means 'how much' or 'how many'. The prices are made up for practice."
